SUMMARY:Connecting Threads (together): Textile Works by Lynn Setterington
DESCRIPTION:Collaboration is at the heart of textile making and this idea is explored in a display of work by UK based artist Lynn Setterington. Through textiles the artist challenges contemporary issues in society and how stitch can be used to commemorate people and communities. Setterington is an ethnographic embroiderer who communicates with the world through stitch. \nMore info: https://arts.ucdavis.edu/events/connecting-threads-together-textile-works-lynn-setterington
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/connecting-threads-together-textile-works-by-lynn-setterington/
