SUMMARY:Danilo Campos: Out and About
DESCRIPTION:Danilo Campos: Out and About\nExhibit: October 9 – November 29\, 2026\nReception: Friday\, October 9\, 2026 (Free) \nDanilo Campos is a Sacramento-based artist whose recent series of paintings explore his love of new places and experiences. His antidote to everyday routines is to go out and wander\, whether it’s a new neighborhood\, a new place\, or campsite. His current series of work reflects his way of seeming to mindlessly go ‘out and about\,’ but coming back with gems of resources. \nThis exhibit is sponsored by Kim Ohlson & Allen Barnes. \nImage: Danilo Campos\, “Sheltered Cove”
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/danilo-campos-out-and-about/
LOCATION:Pence Gallery\, 212 D Street\, Davis\, CA\, 95616\, United States
CATEGORIES:Art
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://thedirt.online/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Danilo-Campos-Sheltered-Cove-scaled.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Pence Gallery":MAILTO:pencegallery@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
