SUMMARY:The Gift of Fashion: From the Maria Manetti Shrem Haute Couture Collection
DESCRIPTION:The Gift of Fashion: From the Maria Manetti Shrem Haute Couture Collection showcases the art of Italian design through seven couture gowns and 16 pieces of jewelry by Roberto Capucci\, Dolce & Gabbana\, and Bulgari. These intricately designed\, one-of-a-kind couture creations illustrate the intersection of aesthetics and functionality and tell the story of philanthropist and fashion icon Maria Manetti Shrem. Free admission\, no reservations needed. \nMore info: https://arts.ucdavis.edu/design/gift-fashion-maria-manetti-shrem-haute-couture-collection
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/the-gift-of-fashion-from-the-maria-manetti-shrem-haute-couture-collection/
