SUMMARY:Pence Gallery Holiday Market
DESCRIPTION:Pence Gallery Holiday Market\nNovember 13 – December 24\, 11:30 AM – 5 PM (Open daily*)\nReception: November 13\, 6-9 PM (Free)\nOur Holiday Market is a treasure trove of hand-crafted items created by regional artists and artisans\, perfect for holiday gift giving. Visitors can enjoy shopping for unique ceramics\, cozy knit scarves\, handmade jewelry\, amazing paintings\, and more! There are over 50 artists participating this year\, and our gallery will be overflowing with fun items that will make great gifts for loved ones. \nHoliday Market Member Opening\nFriday\, November 13\, 10:30-11:30 AM (Free)\nPence Members are invited to enjoy a private opening of the Holiday Market from 10:30-11:30 AM. Enjoy delicious treats and coffee\, while getting first dibs on shopping for holiday treasures. Pence Members receive 10% off Holiday Market purchases. Not a Member? Sign up online at pencegallery.org or in person at the gallery. \n*The Holiday Market is open daily from 11:30 AM – 5 PM (including Mondays)\, with the following exceptions:\nNov. 25: Closes at 3 PM\nNov. 26: Closed for Thanksgiving Day\nDec. 24: Closes at 3 PM (final day)
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/pence-gallery-holiday-market/
