SUMMARY:Davis Youth Choir Spring 2027 Registration
DESCRIPTION:Registration is now open for the Davis Youth Choir spring 2027 season! Davis Youth Choir\, part of Davis Sings\, welcomes young singers from kindergarten through 12th grade to learn\, grow\, and make music together. \nHummingbirds: Kindergarten to 2nd grade\, Wednesdays 2:45 to 3:45 p.m.\, $100/semester\, all skill levels welcome. \nLarks: 3rd to 6th grade\, Wednesdays 4:00 to 5:15 p.m.\, $250/semester\, all skill levels welcome. \nBel Canto: 6th to 12th grade\, Thursdays 7:00 to 8:15 p.m.\, $250/semester\, advanced skills. \nPlease complete one registration form per child. Sliding scale tuition is available. No refunds after 2/11. If you are unsure which choir is the best fit\, please contact choir director\, LuAnn\, on our website. \nRegister at davissings.org/davis-youth-choir
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/davis-youth-choir-spring-2027-registration/
LOCATION:CA
CATEGORIES:Bring the Kids,Music,Stage & Dance
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://thedirt.online/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Join-the-Davis-Youth-Choir-Fall-registration-now-open-1350-x-1350-px.jpg
END:VEVENT
