SUMMARY:Tree Davis Planting Event at Toad Hollow Dog Park
DESCRIPTION:Help us plant trees in the Toad Hollow dog park! We will be digging tree holes\, planting trees\, and installing support stakes. \nWe will be meeting at 1919 2nd St. Overflow parking is available along 2nd St. \nPlease reach out to info@treedavis.org if you would like to sign up with a group of 10 volunteers or more. If you do not reach out\, we will not hold your reservation. \nSafety – All volunteers must bring their own water\, snacks\, sun protection\, and wear closed toed shoes. \nWe request that volunteers who are feeling ill in any form wait until they are fully recovered to participate in Tree Davis events.
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/tree-davis-planting-event-at-toad-hollow-dog-park/
