SUMMARY:Aspect Ratio - Liz Awesome
DESCRIPTION:Experience “Aspect Ratio\,” a solo exhibition by Liz Awesome. The exhibit will transform the space into a work-life balance environment\, featuring mixed media inspired by local flora and highlighting the importance of community engagement. Join us Nov 14\, 5:30-8pm for the opening reception of Liz Awesome’s “Aspect Ratio.” Asserting alternate economic models within conceptual art. Free and open to the public!
