SUMMARY:Pamela Trokanski Dance Theatre 2026 Fall Concert - Walking Contradictions
DESCRIPTION:The Pamela Trokanski Dance Theatre invites the community to join them for the premiere of their Fall Concert: Walking Contradictions\, a thoughtful\, and sometimes humorous exploration of our lives as asymmetrical beings\, finding beauty in the balance of symmetry but at the same time seemingly unable to escape what is unbalanced\, whether that is in ourselves\, our communities\, or in how we behave in the world around us.\nJoining the PTDT are the PTDT Apprentice Company\, Light Ballet Company\, and The Third Stage. Known for work that integrates a strong sense of athleticism and technical training with idiosyncratic movements and a diverse range of movers\, including dancers ranging in age from 10 to 90+\, this is not your average dance performance!\nTickets are available in advance and at the door.\nGeneral Admission – $20\nChildren\, Students\, and Adults 65+ – $15\n(A 4% surcharge is added to all electronic payments)
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/pamela-trokanski-dance-theatre-2026-fall-concert-walking-contradictions-2/
LOCATION:Louise H Kellogg Memorial Theater at the Pamela Trokanski Dance Workshop\, 2720 Del Rio Place\, Davis\, CA\, 95618\, United States
CATEGORIES:Bring the Kids,Community,Stage & Dance
